lly sad that you know this is  somewhat of a lower income area built a  lot longer ago and just seems to be a  bit forgotten about  now i did speak with city officials on  the phone about 30 minutes ago they did  tell me that they emphasized with  empathize excuse me with the residents  here in the community but that it has  not been officially  made that this mesh was the reason  behind the flooding of course they're  still looking into it and they do say  that the construction project is a big  one that they're expecting it to be  finished by next year or 2024. of course  we'll be looking into all of that so  stick with us right here on air online  and on social for the latest for now i'm  candice charles 8 news now
 

